  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/EXCLUSIVE_WEAPONS_ARMORS_TOOLS/MP_EXCLUSIVE_WEAPONS_Header.webp\" width=\"1920\" height=\"705\"></strong></span></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">這個模組透過使用<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/superoreblock\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>SuperOreBlock</strong></span></em></a>新增的超級礦石方塊，添加了一套升級版的武器、工具和盔甲。這些新物品比原版裝備略為強大，提供自然的強度提升而不會過於破壞平衡。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>需要和朋友一起遊玩的伺服器嗎？</strong></span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/EXCLUSIVE_WEAPONS_ARMORS_TOOLS/MP_EXCLUSIVE_WEAPONS_Promo.webp\" width=\"1920\" height=\"285\"></strong></a></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果您正在尋找能與朋友遊玩任何模組或模組包的伺服器，<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting</a></strong>就是您的解決方案！他們提供性價比最高的Minecraft伺服器，點擊<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">此連結</a></strong>並使用代碼\"Lupin\"即可獲得25%折扣。</span><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/EXCLUSIVE_WEAPONS_ARMORS_TOOLS/MP_EXCLUSIVE_WEAPONS_Description.webp\" width=\"1920\" height=\"190\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">特色：</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">由<strong>超級鐵</strong>、<strong>超級金</strong>、<strong>超級鑽石</strong>和<strong>超級獄髓方塊</strong>製成的新盔甲套裝</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">與普通裝備相比略為提升的數值——設計上既有獎勵感又保持平衡</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">物品透過<strong>鍛造台</strong>升級：</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">將標準物品（如鐵胸甲或鑽石劍）與對應的超級方塊結合，即可製作強化版本</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">本模組非常適合希望在原版友好進程系統中獲得額外裝備層級的玩家</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/EXCLUSIVE_WEAPONS_ARMORS_TOOLS/MP_EXCLUSIVE_WEAPONS_Faq.webp\" width=\"1920\" height=\"190\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>能在伺服器上運作嗎？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">當然！運作完全正常！請記住，與朋友遊玩模組的最佳方式是使用BisectHosting，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>點擊此連結可獲得25%折扣</strong></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>這個模組能用在模組包裡嗎？</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然可以！只要僅在Modrinth或CurseForge上發布。將其上傳到任何其他平台將侵犯我們的權利，是完全不允許的</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">不過，如果您考慮將其加入您的Modrinth或CurseForge模組包，我們將非常感激。如果需要任何小調整或有任何問題，請聯絡我們！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>我可以在頻道上錄製這個模組的影片嗎？</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然，您可以在您的頻道上自由遊玩這個模組或我們的任何模組包並製作相關影片，事實上，我們會非常感謝！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/EXCLUSIVE_WEAPONS_ARMORS_TOOLS/MP_EXCLUSIVE_WEAPONS_Screenshots.webp\" width=\"1920\" height=\"189\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1222/280/exclusive-weapons-armor-and-tools-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1222/282/exclusive-weapons-armor-and-tools-4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1222/284/exclusive-weapons-armor-and-tools-6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1222/285/exclusive-weapons-armor-and-tools-7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X8VY5WMbe4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MultiRecipe/BH_Lupin_Discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"285\"></strong></span></a></span></span></p>",
